  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Disability Forum Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will provide a core funding contribution to the Pacific Disability Forum (PDF) to support PDF work in protecting and advancing the rights of all persons with disabilities in the Pacific, pursuing a disability-inclusive Pacific, and elevating Pacific perspectives on disability inclusion internationally.</narrative>
  </description>
